lass="px-3 py-2">CRITICAL</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">System</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Complete data exposure</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>📊 Threat Landscape</h3><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Threat</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Likelihood</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Impact</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Priority</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Phone theft/loss</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔴 HIGH</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔴 CRITICAL</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">P0</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Unauthorized local access</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🟡 MEDIUM</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔴 HIGH</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">P0</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Data corruption</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🟡 MEDIUM</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🟡 MEDIUM</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">P1</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Malicious app modification</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🟢 LOW</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔴 HIGH</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">P1</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Cloud sync interception</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🟢 LOW</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔴 HIGH</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">P2</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">SMS spoofing</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🟢 VERY LOW</td><td node="[object Objec