<li><strong>Physical:</strong> Device lock (OS-level protection)</li>
<li><strong>App Authentication:</strong> PIN/biometric (app-level)</li>
<li><strong>Data Encryption:</strong> SQLCipher (at rest)</li>
<li><strong>Network Security:</strong> HTTPS + pinning (in transit)</li>
<li><strong>Backup Security:</strong> Encrypted + signed backups</li>
<li><strong>Monitoring:</strong> Audit logs + anomaly detection</li>
</ol><hr><h2>2. Threat Model (STRIDE Analysis)</h2><h3>🛡️ STRIDE Framework</h3><h4><strong>S - Spoofing (Identity Theft)</strong></h4><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Threat</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Attack Scenario</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Impact</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Likelihood</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Mitigation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">App impersonation</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Fake app on Play Store with similar name</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Users install malware</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">LOW</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Unique package name, verify developer signature</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">User impersonation</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Employee/family accesses owner's phone</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Unauthorized data access</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">HIGH</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">App-level PIN/biometric mandatory</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">SMS spoofing</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Attacker sends fake SMS from owner's number</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Customer confusion, payment disputes</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">LOW</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">No direct mitigation (SMS limitation), move to WhatsApp Phase 2</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Code Mitigation:</strong></p><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose re