<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 🎯 Security Overview</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Threat Landscape</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">Hamare app ko ye threats face kar sakte hain:</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Threat | Likelihood | Impact | Priority |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">|--------|-----------|--------|----------|</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Phone theft/loss | HIGH | CRITICAL | P0 |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Unauthorized local access | MEDIUM | HIGH | P0 |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Data corruption (accidental) | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | P1 |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Malicious app modification | LOW | HIGH | P1 |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Cloud sync interception | LOW | HIGH | P2 |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| SMS interception | VERY LOW | MEDIUM | P3 |</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">---</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 🏗️ Security Architecture</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Defense-in-Depth Strategy</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">```mermaid</span></span>
