<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 📌 Project Overview</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">Digital khata book for small flour mill (atta chakki) owners to manage </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">customer grinding records, payments, and automated SMS notifications.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 🎯 Target Users</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Primary:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Small chakki owners (1-2 operators, 20-100 customers/day)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Secondary:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Customers (receive SMS, no app needed)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Age Group:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> 35-60 years (limited tech knowledge)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Location:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Tier 2/3 cities, rural areas (Hindi belt)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 💡 Core Problem Solved</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Current Pain:**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Paper register mein likhte hain → Lost/damaged, calculation errors</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> SMS manually type karna padta hai → Time consuming</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Udhar ka hisaab bhool jaate hain → Money loss</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Purane records dhoondhna mushkil → No history</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Our Solution:**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Quick digital entry (30 seconds per customer)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Auto SMS from owner's phone (trusted number)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Automatic udhar calculation</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Search customer by name/phone instantly</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Monthly reports (total business, pending payments)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 🚀 Core Goals</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">1.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Speed:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Entry &lt; 30 seconds (faster than paper)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">2.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Reliability:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Works offline, syncs when online</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">3.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Trust:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> SMS owner ke number se jaaye (not 3rd party)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">4.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Simple:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Kaka-level UI (big buttons, Hindi language)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">5.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Accurate:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Auto-calculate kharcha, baki amount</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 📊 Current Phase</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Status:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> 🚧 MVP Development (Month 1-2)</span></span>
