<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 🔒 Critical Constraints</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Budget:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> ₹0 hosting (initially), max ₹500/month later</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Internet:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Must work without internet (rural areas)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Device:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Android 8+ (old phones bhi chalein)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **SMS:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> FREE (owner ka SIM use karo, no Twilio/SMS Gateway)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Language:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Hindi primary (English optional)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 🎯 Key Decisions Made</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Why Mobile App (not Web)?</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Chakki par laptop nahi hota, phone hota hai</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> SMS bhejne ke liye native Android API chahiye</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Offline-first easy in mobile</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Camera for customer photo (future feature)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Why Offline-First?</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Bijli ka issue (frequent power cuts)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Internet unstable (BSNL 2G areas)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Owner can't wait for "loading..." </span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Why SMS from Owner's Phone?</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Customer trust (dekha hua number)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> FREE (unlimited SMS in most plans)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> No dependency on payment gateways</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Regulatory compliance (no DLT registration needed)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Why SQLite (not Cloud DB)?</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Offline works perfectly</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> No server cost</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Fast queries (&lt; 1000 customers)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Backup via Google Drive sync (later)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## 📚 Glossary</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| Term | Meaning |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">|------|---------|</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Pisai**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Grinding/milling service |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Udhar**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Credit (payment pending) |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Khata**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Ledger/account book |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Daliya**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Broken wheat (coarse grain) |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Jama**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Credit entry (received payment) |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Naam**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Debit entry (gave service) |</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">| </span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold">**Baki**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> | Remaining balance (pending amount) |</span></span>
