<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## Phase 1: MVP (Month 1-2) — 🚧 60% Complete</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### ✅ Completed</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> [</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">x</span><span style="color:#24292E">] Database schema design</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> [</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">x</span><span style="color:#24292E">] Basic app shell (navigation)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> [</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">x</span><span style="color:#24292E">] Customer list screen (read-only)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### 🚧 In Progress</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> [ ] Customer CRUD operations (80% done)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> [ ] Entry form UI (50% done)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### 📋 Next Up (Priority Order)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">1.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Customer Management**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P0 - CRITICAL)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Add new customer (Name, Phone, Address, Photo?)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Edit customer details</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Search by name/phone</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> View customer history</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Why First:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Core entity, sab kuch iske around</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">2.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Grinding Entry**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P0 - CRITICAL)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Quick entry form: Date, Customer, Grain Type, Weight, Rate</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Auto-calculate amount (Weight × Rate)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Payment mode: Cash/UPI/Udhar</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Save entry (offline)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Why Second:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Main business transaction</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">3.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **SMS Service**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P0 - CRITICAL)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Background service (Android WorkManager)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Template: "Ram ji, aapka 50kg gehun pisa gaya. Rs.150. Dhanyawad - Shyam Chakki"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Send from owner's SIM (default SIM selection)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Retry on failure (queue mechanism)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Why Third:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Customer satisfaction, differentiator</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">4.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Udhar Ledger**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P0 - MUST HAVE)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Customer-wise pending amount</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Total outstanding across all customers</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> "Collect Payment" button (updates ledger)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Filter: Show only udhar customers</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Why Fourth:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Money recovery critical</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">5.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Daily Summary**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P1 - SHOULD HAVE)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Today's total business (₹)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Total weight ground (kg)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Cash received vs Udhar given</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Most popular grain type</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Why Fifth:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Business insights for owner</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Success Metrics (MVP)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> ✅ Entry time &lt; 30 seconds (vs 2 min in paper)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> ✅ SMS delivery rate &gt; 95%</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> ✅ Zero data loss (offline sync works)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> ✅ 5 beta chakkis using daily</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> ✅ Owner rating: "Bahut accha" (4/5+)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">---</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">## Phase 2: Growth Features (Month 3-4) — 📋 Planned</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5;font-weight:bold">### Features</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">1.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Payment Reminders**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P1)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Weekly SMS to udhar customers</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Template: "Namaste, aapka baki: Rs.500. Jaldi payment kar dijiye"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Configurable (owner can disable)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Why:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Improve collection rate</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">   -</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Impact:**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> Expected 30% faster payment</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">2.</span><span style="color:#24292E;font-weight:bold"> **Rate Management**</span><span style="color:#24292E"> (P1)</span></span>
