g><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-light shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>---</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### 4️⃣ `SMS_SERVICE_SPEC.md` — Background SMS Implementation</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>```markdown</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># SMS Service Specification</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>## Overview</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>**Goal:** Send automated SMS to customers from owner's phone number </span></span>
<span class="line"><span>using Android's native SMS API.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>**Why not Twilio/MSG91:**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Cost: ₹0 (owner's unlimited plan)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Trust: Customer recognizes sender number</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- No DLT registration needed</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>---</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>## Technical Architecture</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### Technology Stack</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- **Platform:** React Native / Expo (with dev client for native modules)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- **SMS Module:** `react-native-sms` or `expo-sms`</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- **Background Service:** `expo-task-manager` + `expo-background-fetch`</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- **Queue:** SQLite table (`sms_queue`)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>---</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>## SMS Flow Diagram</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>```mermaid</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>sequenceDiagram</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant User as Owner</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant App</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant DB as SQLite</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant Queue as SMS Queue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant BG as Background Service</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant Android as Android SMS API</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    participant Customer</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    User-&gt;&gt;App: Creates entry</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    App-&gt;&gt;DB: Insert entry</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    DB-&gt;&gt;Queue: Trigger adds SMS to queue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    App-&gt;&gt;User: Entry saved ✅</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    </span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Note over BG: Runs every 5 minutes</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    BG-&gt;&gt;Queue: Fetch pending SMS</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Queue-&gt;&gt;BG: Return 10 pending</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    </span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    loop For each SMS</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        BG-&gt;&gt;Android: Send SMS</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        Android-&gt;&gt;Customer: SMS delivered</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        Android-&gt;&gt;BG: Delivery report</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        BG-&gt;&gt;Queue: Update status (SENT/FAILED)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        BG-&gt;&gt;DB: Update entry.sms_status</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    end</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><hr><h2>Implementation</h2><h3>1. SMS Queue Table (Already in DATABASE_SCHEMA.md)</h3><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">SQL</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-