<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">};</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><hr><h2>Cost Analysis</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Factor</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Monthly Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">SMS API (Twilio)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">~₹500 (100 SMS/day)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Our Approach (Owner SIM)</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>₹0</strong> (Unlimited plan)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Maintenance</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">₹0 (no server)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Savings:</strong> ₹6,000/year per chakki</p><hr><h2>Limitations &amp; Mitigation</h2><h3>Limitation 1: iOS doesn't support background SMS</h3><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Android-only feature (90%+ chakki owners use Android)</p><h3>Limitation 2: Dual SIM confusion</h3><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Let user select default SIM in settings</p><h3>Limitation 3: SMS quota exceeded (carrier limits)</h3><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong></p><ul>
<li>Batch send (max 100/hour)</li>
<li>Show warning if queue &gt; 200</li>
</ul><h3>Limitation 4: Message length &gt; 160 chars</h3><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Keep template concise, split if needed</p><hr><h2>Future Enhancements (Phase 3)</h2><ul>
<li><strong>WhatsApp Integration:</strong> Send via WhatsApp Business API</li>
<li><strong>Rich Messages:</strong> Include chakki logo, payment link</li>
<li><strong>Scheduled SMS:</strong> Send reminders at specific time (9 AM)</li>
<li><strong>Bulk SMS:</strong> Festival greetings to all customers</li>
</ul><hr><p>Last Updated: 2024-01-15<br>
