<span class="line"><span>### 5️⃣ `UI_UX_GUIDELINES.md` (Kaka-Proof Design)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>```markdown</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># UI/UX Guidelines - Atta Chakki App</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>## Design Philosophy</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>**"Kaka bhi chala sake, 30 second mein entry ho jaye"**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>---</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>## Principles</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### 1. **Hindi First**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- All primary labels in Devanagari: "ग्राहक जोड़ें" not "Add Customer"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- English subtitle below (small, gray): "Add Customer"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Numbers in International (1, 2, 3) not Devanagari (१, २, ३) for speed</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### 2. **Big Touch Targets**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Minimum button size: **60dp × 60dp** (vs standard 48dp)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Spacing between buttons: **16dp minimum**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- List items: **72dp height** (comfortable for thick fingers)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### 3. **High Contrast**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Background: White (#FFFFFF)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Text: Dark Gray (#212121) — not pure black (eye strain)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Primary action: Green (#4CAF50) — universally understood</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Danger: Red (#F44336)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Pending/Warning: Orange (#FF9800)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### 4. **No Complex Navigation**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Max 2 levels deep</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Bottom tab bar: 4 icons max (ग्राहक, Entry, उधार, More)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Back button always visible (Android back + header back)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>### 5. **Auto-Save Everything**</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- No "Save" button</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Save on every field blur</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>- Show subtle "Saved ✓" indicator</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>---</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
