"FEATURE_SPECS/PHASE-2/ai-recommendations.md" banao:</p><h1>Feature: AI Recommendations</h1><h2>Status</h2><p>📋 Planned for Phase 2 (Month 3-4)</p><h2>Overview</h2><p><strong>What:</strong> Personalized AI-powered recommendations based on user behavior<br>
<strong>Why:</strong> Increase engagement by 40%, competitive differentiator<br>
<strong>For Whom:</strong> All active users with &gt;10 interactions</p><hr><h2>User Story</h2><p>As a <strong>regular user</strong>, I want <strong>personalized content recommendations</strong><br>
so that <strong>I discover relevant content faster without manual searching</strong>.</p><hr><h2>Requirements</h2><h3>Functional Requirements</h3><ol>
<li>
<p><strong>Must Have (P0)</strong></p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Show 10 personalized recommendations on dashboard</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Update recommendations daily based on activity</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Allow users to rate recommendations (helpful/not helpful)</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Store feedback to improve future suggestions</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Should Have (P1)</strong></p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Real-time recommendations (update on every action)</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Category-wise filtering</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> "Explain why recommended" tooltip</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Nice to Have (P2)</strong></p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Save recommendations for later</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Share recommendations with friends</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol><h3>Non-Functional Requirements</h3><ul>
<li>Response time: &lt; 200ms</li>
<li>Accuracy: &gt;75% relevance rate</li>
<li>Privacy: No third-party data sharing</li>
<li>Scalability: Handle 10K concurrent users</li>
</ul><hr><h2>User Flow</h2><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">mermaid</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-light shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span>graph LR</span></span>
