<li><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">RecommendationGrid</code> — Container for all cards</li>
<li><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">FeedbackButton</code> — Thumbs up/down</li>
<li><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">ExplainTooltip</code> — Shows why recommended</li>
</ul><h3>Wireframe Description</h3><p>[Location: Dashboard, below "Recent Activity"]</p><ul>
