<li>Spacing: 16px gap</li>
<li>Border radius: 8px</li>
<li>Hover effect: Lift + shadow</li>
</ul><hr><h2>Technical Design</h2><h3>Architecture Changes Needed</h3><ol>
<li><strong>New Microservice</strong>: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">recommendation-service</code> (Python/FastAPI)</li>
<li><strong>ML Model</strong>: Collaborative filtering + content-based hybrid</li>
