<span class="line"><span>**📋 Prompt:**</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><p>"EXPERIMENTS.md" banao jisme future experiments track karein:</p><h1>Experiments &amp; A/B Tests</h1><h2>Active Experiments</h2><h3>EXP-001: AI Recommendations Layout</h3><ul>
<li><strong>Hypothesis:</strong> Horizontal scroll performs better than grid</li>
<li><strong>Variants:</strong>
<ul>
