<li>B (Test): Horizontal scrollable cards</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>Traffic Split:</strong> 50/50</li>
<li><strong>Metric:</strong> CTR on recommendations</li>
<li><strong>Start Date:</strong> 2024-03-01</li>
<li><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 weeks</li>
<li><strong>Status:</strong> 🔴 Running</li>
<li><strong>Early Results:</strong> B winning by 12% (not significant yet)</li>
</ul><hr><h2>Planned Experiments (Phase 2)</h2><h3>EXP-002: Onboarding Flow Simplification</h3><ul>
