normal message hai—scroll karne par nazar nahi aayega. SMS plugin mein number-cleaning bug bhi hai, aur SMS ka actual send result check kiye bina success return ho raha hai. Main local APK setup aur GitHub build ka difference bhi verify kar raha hoon, taaki build-specific problem ko sabhi APKs par apply na kar doon.</p></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="body-sm group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 leading-[1]"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 17H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5 7L10 12L5 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary shrink-0">Ran commands</span><span class="text-text-tertiary">2</span></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="body-sm group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 leading-[1]"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M17 17L21 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3 11C3 15.4183 6.58172 19 11 19C13.213 19 15.2161 18.1015 16.6644 16.6493C18.1077 15.2022 19 13.2053 19 11C19 6.58172 15.4183 3 11 3C6.58172 3 3 6.58172 3 11Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary shrink-0">Searched the web</span></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">186ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Maine <strong>read-only audit</strong> kiya hai—koi code/configuration change nahi ki. <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">git diff</code> clean hai.</p><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> Toast ke liye placement/visibility issue mila hai. Auto-SMS mein number-cleaning bug, local APK setup ki kami aur SMS failure detect na karne ki problem mili hai.</p><h2>1. Auto-SMS ke bugs</h2><h3>🔴 Valid mobile numbers galat clean ho rahe hain</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/native/android-plugin/com/chakkimitra/plugin/BackgroundSmsPlugin.java#L103-L106" class="text-interactive-link">BackgroundSmsPlugin.java:103–106</a></p><p>Code number ki length dekhe bina shuru ka <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">91</code> hata deta hai. Isliye <strong>10-digit mobile number jo khud <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">91</code> se shuru ho</strong>, woh corrupt ho jaata hai.</p><p>Read-only check mein:</p><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="m-0 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-none px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[#24292e] dark:text-[#e1e4e8]"><code class="text-[11px] leading-normal sm:text-[13px]">Input:   9123456789
Cleaned: 23456789
Result:  “Invalid phone number: too short”</code></pre></div></div></pre><p>Yeh <strong>confirmed bug</strong> hai; affected numbers par SMS send attempt tak nahi pahunchega.</p><h3>🔴 Local Android setup mein plugin registration aur permission missing hain</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/scripts/setup-android.sh#L16-L24" class="text-interactive-link">scripts/setup-android.sh:16–24</a></p><p>Local setup script sirf plugin ki Java file copy karti hai. Woh:</p><ul>
<li>Custom <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">MainActivity.java</code> copy nahi karti, jisme plugin registration hai.</li>
<li>Manifest mein <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">SEND_SMS</code> permission add nahi karti.</li>
</ul><p><strong>Agar fresh APK is script se banayi gayi hai</strong>, SMS plugin usable nahi hoga.</p><p><strong>Important distinction:</strong> Current <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/.github/workflows/build-android.yml#L75-L102" class="text-interactive-link">GitHub workflow:75–102</a> mein permission aur MainActivity/plugin copying already present hain. Isliye <em>har APK mein plugin missing hai</em> kehna sahi nahi hoga.</p><h3>🔴 SMS actually send hua ya nahi—code check hi nahi karta</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/native/android-plugin/com/chakkimitra/plugin/BackgroundSmsPlugin.java#L136-L146" class="text-interactive-link">BackgroundSmsPlugin.java:136–146</a></p><p>Dono send methods mein sent/delivery callbacks <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">null</code> hain. Method call ke turant baad plugin:</p><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="m-0 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-none px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[#24292e] dark:text-[#e1e4e8]"><code class="text-[11px] leading-normal sm:text-[13px]">success: true
“SMS sent successfully”</code></pre></div></div></pre><p>return karta hai.</p><p><strong>Impact:</strong> Android ko request dena hi “SMS bhej diya” maana ja raha hai. Baad mein hone wali sending failure JS <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">catch</code> tak nahi aayegi.</p><p>Saath hi <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/native/android-plugin/com/chakkimitra/plugin/BackgroundSmsPlugin.java#L113" class="text-interactive-link">line 113</a> par sirf <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">SmsManager.getDefault()</code> use hota hai. Multi-SIM device mein suitable default SMS subscription na hone par send fail ho sakta hai; Android API bhi yeh condition document karti hai. Yeh <strong>device-dependent possibility</strong> hai, aapke phone par confirmed diagnosis nahi. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/telephony/java/android/telephony/SmsManager.java" class="text-interactive-link">2</a></p><h3>🟠 Naye customer ki first entry par SMS silently skip ho sakta hai</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L176-L185" class="text-interactive-link">QuickEntry.tsx:176–185</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L145-L147" class="text-interactive-link">145–147</a></p><p>Customer create hone par uski ID select ho jaati hai, lekin updated customer list baad mein async load hoti hai. Beech mein entry save karne par:</p><ul>
<li>Transaction save ho sakti hai.</li>
<li><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">customers.find(...)</code> customer nahi dhoondh paata.</li>
<li>SMS skip hota hai; <strong>skip ka warning/message nahi hai</strong>.</li>
</ul><p>Is missing-customer case ko mocked control-flow check mein reproduce kiya.</p><h2>2. Toast show nahi hone ke reasons</h2><h3>🔴 “Toast” actually scrollable page ke top par normal banner hai</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L199-L208" class="text-interactive-link">QuickEntry.tsx:199–208</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/Settings.tsx#L160-L165" class="text-interactive-link">Settings.tsx:160–165</a></p><p>Messages fixed popup/overlay nahi hain. Woh <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/PullToRefresh.tsx#L63-L69" class="text-interactive-link">scrollable container</a> ke andar normal content hain.</p><p><strong>Neeche scroll karke Save dabane par message upar, visible area ke bahar ho sakta hai.</strong> QuickEntry ka normal message 3 seconds mein clear bhi ho jaata hai. Yeh toast “show nahi hua” ka sabse direct code-level explanation hai.</p><h3>🟠 Messages overwrite hote hain aur tab change par kho jaate hain</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L137-L163" class="text-interactive-link">QuickEntry.tsx:137–163</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/app/page.tsx#L152-L159" class="text-interactive-link">page.tsx:152–159</a></p><ul>
<li>Entry-save success aur SMS result ek hi <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">message</code> state use karte hain. SMS result pehle message ko replace kar deta hai.</li>
<li>Home se doosre tab par jaane par <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">QuickEntry</code> unmount hota hai. Pending SMS ka result doosre tab par dikhane ke liye shared notification system nahi hai.</li>
</ul><h3>🟠 Settings mein purana timer naye message ko hata deta hai</h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/Settings.tsx#L103-L105" class="text-interactive-link">Settings.tsx:103–105</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/Settings.tsx#L133-L134" class="text-interactive-link">133–134</a></p><p>Settings ke actions apne timers start karte hain, lekin purana timer cancel nahi hota. Save ke turant baad backup action karne par pehle action ka timer <strong>naya message jaldi clear</strong> kar deta hai. Mocked timer test mein confirm hua.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> QuickEntry mein previous timer clear hota hai; yeh particular bug Settings mein hai.</p><h3>🟠 Kuch feedback misleading ya implemented hi nahi hai</h3><ul>
<li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/Settings.tsx#L97-L107" class="text-interactive-link">Settings.tsx:97–107</a>: HTTP response ka <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">res.ok</code> check nahi hota. Mocked <strong>HTTP 500 par bhi “सेटिंग सेव हो गई!”</strong> aaya.</li>
<li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/CustomerDetail.tsx#L100-L119" class="text-interactive-link">CustomerDetail.tsx:100–119</a>: Payment save/failure ke liye toast call hi nahi hai; caught error sirf console mein jaata hai.</li>
</ul><h2>3. Background service ke baare mein important clarification</h2><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L124-L166" class="text-interactive-link">QuickEntry.tsx:124–166</a> mein SMS <strong>successful entry-save ke baad native platform par hi</strong> trigger hota hai. Browser/PWA par yeh silently skip hota hai.</p><p>Plugin SMS app khole bina send attempt karta hai, lekin <strong>app band/kill hone ke baad pending SMS process/retry karne wali persistent background service ya queue implemented nahi hai</strong>.</p><p>Ek additional edge-case bhi mila: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://arena.ai/c/native/android-plugin/com/chakkimitra/plugin/BackgroundSmsPlugin.java#L121-L130" class="text-interactive-link">Unicode splitting:121–130</a> mein fixed 67 UTF-16 units par text cut hota hai; boundary par emoji aane se uska surrogate pair toot sakta hai.</p><p><strong>Verification limit:</strong> Phone-cleaning aur selected save/message flows read-only, in-memory checks se verify kiye. Actual Android/SIM sending aur installed APK test nahi hua. Isliye aapke device par kaunsa SMS issue trigger ho raha hai, uske liye APK build source/version aur Logcat evidence chahiye.</p></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4